", "id": "569025656185476", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473397316_569025659518809_1129938089592913200_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wcMkTInCYZsQ7kNvwEXBcou&_nc_oc=AdnIG4-b09BEeT9cBiCJPdjO4STtP2oDNxle8MZXu6yrRGba-e2fewY7PfZMB8Imyl0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsZpBFDWxVKeu7sDC6o9g1TVBxTy8gjC_qN1wPWlqUxXQ&oe=69A4262A"}]}, "id": "1339729720412434", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "Screenshot1.png", "id": "1278859143198705", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391924_1278859146532038_7918403453860968819_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YFmuD11Nc5EQ7kNvwHO0oyQ&_nc_oc=AdnbB29EStTGFICTZ5NbjTKXOEUXi5nuD9WLnUPaPUL_MddKMHm_-AmFF0utFbIOxSI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsCK4VL9QEEi82H3fKqP-Gwv9Z-UQ3ZEo-2cjOZeAIIew&oe=69A4430D"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot3.png", "id": "653175777576117", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392019_653175780909450_6665210298574887755_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xPKTyVkMk6AQ7kNvwEDu0oa&_nc_oc=AdmGSsYdELHXo76XqecJPrbPX96W3vwF-WG4DU1xE0wyg4PJsUFm1pai6LACrwZr8NU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu9tBxe-pRvKeIFLxbYF-lGf83BS4tpCgDPdbNHcPWRLw&oe=69A42464"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot2.png", "id": "1813951416117142", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391937_1813951419450475_4779584993365986793_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l3up9wFlgVAQ7kNvwGKgSSu&_nc_oc=Adkql7u79khZ5xjN2FZQwjT0FQ82aLLBzVXgi5uXdmlwfpAQdbNxIXq-QIrFF9a3xVI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftF8VCxJqGwLX28E5MhwPfyfrG_jraODFhzWVxfrH1akA&oe=69A41FDF"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot4.png", "id": "633923102942349", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473400793_633923109609015_8038197177680033568_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vY1hxRFQdssQ7kNvwEimPa9&_nc_oc=AdlDdZ4v7dKwmhs5L6nn6F2dKMtIVWDOXkAI7tWh5xVJIYGfJO98NgVNE7uNMGMJPBc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftfievsP8v_ZyIUKTqEM6RiliU5M_bMWilHjHOEddWosQ&oe=69A41D39"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot5.png", "id": "1236615407829870", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1236615411163203_6793625200968117992_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Udk5YgyGu3oQ7kNvwFDFwm6&_nc_oc=Adni61UbHN4ESGoZRFOZnkL0jxcbBElhfB4XvDDqFlHfBARKOhnJ3DFOcfdUEV1UMdQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuGipwXPJlP7-yGEhv3pWfChJh4SxM1MLwoIBq1MBd4ww&oe=69A4264B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverImage.png", "id": "1167487215074082", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391883_1167487218407415_8367507673734608742_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=soMCv1qKXCcQ7kNvwG69adx&_nc_oc=Adm9peKTSXAGOstMNlCFBWZSHrlDP6aaSEcq_e7PXyvYJ1dwrhorxrKOR9J3dG0W-vI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftQ9_OWnk0FOQH4rc8nkTFT_ryGoxJABnq6RHKlJdxusQ&oe=69A424DE"}, "display_name": "Magnificent Ships", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Model ship lovers rejoice! This is a collection of six finely-detailed vessels for viewing at both model- and actual-size. Relax and enjoy the Zen-like experience that piloting small boats on liquid provides.  Pick them up for a closer look.  If you desire stimulation, try your hand at competing against a \"ghost-ship\" to capture the most buoys. For fun, try piloting them around inside a house, or even your own living-room via passthrough/mixed-reality.  Leisurely stroll their decks as they sail upon an ocean with dynamic day/night cycle. Each ship includes an \"action\" event while at sea, whereby mighty cannons fire, ship horns bellow, or the submarine dives.\n\nIncluded Ships:\n- Ocean liner: RMS Queen Mary\n- English \"race built\" galleon: The Mermaid (fictional)\n- Zumwalt class destroyer: USS Zumwalt (DDG-1000)\n- Iowa class battleship: USS Iowa (BB-61)\n- Research vessel: RV Calypso\n- German submarine: U-boat Type VII-C/41 (U-659)\n\nDesigned for use with a single controller:\n- Button A/X: change to next ship (long-press for previous)\n- Button B/Y: change to next environment (long-press for previous)\n- Trigger: move in direction controller is pointing.\n- Grip: (model-scale) grab ship , (full-scale) activate action.\n- Thumbstick: (model-scale) control ship, (full-scale) change-time & snap-turn\n- Thumb button: (ship model) double speed, (submarine model) hold to dive, tap to surface", "short_description": "Remote-control model ships in virtual or mixed-reality!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vroom.space/ships/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VROOM.space", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vroom.space/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9025258787583549"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 8, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "4211684925740530"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1405002918081508"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1821607738519949"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "880528631403650"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1126976229650763"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "6